+// PS2X_PAD_SCRIPT="<sec>:<button>[+<button>...][:<hold_sec>],..." presses buttons at fixed
+// times after the first pad read, for unattended test runs.
+// Analog names: ls_left/right/up/down and rs_left/right/up/down.
